{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e4264bd77f5d5c56","name":"Snare Rifle","source":{"id":"source:reference-e4264bd77f5d5c56","title":"Snare Rifle","revision":19772,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:34:59Z","sha256":"f0172bea629b6528d7bcfa8f95e19a7672d12246577f6dbb71aa8d77eb0bcf55","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19772","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Snare%20Rifle&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e4264bd77f5d5c56","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The need to capture a target alive presents a problem to the bounty hunter. You can't use a Blaster's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," setting beyond very close range (6 squares); ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Grenades"}," work farther away (particularly when used with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade_Launcher","referenceId":"reference:da6a8268b875d982"},"), but they're expensive and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},", so they won't always be available if you're on a planet with strict weapon laws. The Snare Rifle is one alternative, allowing a target to be stopped (or at least slowed down) at a longer range by shooting a weighted cord that wraps around the target.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Snare Rifle allows you to initiate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," against a character at range. If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," attack succeeds, the target takes the listed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage from the force of the snare. A character that is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappled"}," can attempt to escape the snare (requiring a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," check) or break out of it (requiring a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," check). You can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pin","referenceId":"reference:ff1cee74414621d8"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trip"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trip","referenceId":"reference:bd13d5a0906be48e"}," feats with a Snare Rifle, but you cannot use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crush"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crush","referenceId":"reference:fd4982bc31020a05"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Throw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Throw","referenceId":"reference:c78054582e89a9a7"}," feats.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Snare Rifle uses a specialized cartridge that holds 5 shots. Replacement cartridges weigh 2 kg and cost 50 credits each.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," -\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES (Only, 1d6)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Bludgeoning\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
